        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into monster-filled dungeons in search of answers to the mysteries of Cloudacre! Using the magic of the glyphs, craft new and powerful spells to help you fight against the hordes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4147730/extras/6ecd98dfd4ecf7e3728bd259837e5878.poster.avif?t=1764306484\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4147730/extras/6ecd98dfd4ecf7e3728bd259837e5878.webm?t=1764306484\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up your spells and character as you fight. Even the most basic spell can become an elemental scythe to mow down your foes. Defeat is only the beginning, though. Return to town, craft better gear, change up your spells, and dive back into the dungeon once more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4147730/extras/136a9a8168d9712aae76608c045df675.poster.avif?t=1764306484\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4147730/extras/136a9a8168d9712aae76608c045df675.webm?t=1764306484\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In between dungeon runs, return to town to talk with the residents of Cloudacre. Aid them in their tasks to get new glyphs and sigils, and recipes for better gear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survivors of Cloudacre was made with zero AI, from conception to completion. No AI was used to prototype, plan, ideate, or create any aspect of this game. I'm a solo developer, author, and supporter of the arts in all their forms, and have strong aversion (maybe abhorrence is a better word) to the use of AI in any creative endeavor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into monster-filled dungeons in search of answers to the mysteries of Cloudacre! Using the magic of the glyphs, craft new and powerful spells to help you fight against the hordes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4147730/extras/6ecd98dfd4ecf7e3728bd259837e5878.poster.avif?t=1764306484\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4147730/extras/6ecd98dfd4ecf7e3728bd259837e5878.webm?t=1764306484\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up your spells and character as you fight. Even the most basic spell can become an elemental scythe to mow down your foes. Defeat is only the beginning, though. Return to town, craft better gear, change up your spells, and dive back into the dungeon once more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4147730/extras/136a9a8168d9712aae76608c045df675.poster.avif?t=1764306484\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4147730/extras/136a9a8168d9712aae76608c045df675.webm?t=1764306484\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In between dungeon runs, return to town to talk with the residents of Cloudacre. Aid them in their tasks to get new glyphs and sigils, and recipes for better gear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survivors of Cloudacre was made with zero AI, from conception to completion. No AI was used to prototype, plan, ideate, or create any aspect of this game. I'm a solo developer, author, and supporter of the arts in all their forms, and have strong aversion (maybe abhorrence is a better word) to the use of AI in any creative endeavor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
